  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot Migration and Border Management System Vanuatu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to support re-opening Vanuatu&#x2019;s international borders through the installation of an integrated border management system at one pilot port (Bauerfield International Airport) and the VIS headquarters in Port Vila, Vanuatu. This will contribute to the Government of Vanuatu&#x2019;s efforts to improve border and customs cooperation, improve management of migration across the border and support interoperability with the existing ASYCUDA customs management system.  The overall objective of the project is to contribute to the Government of Vanuatu&#x2019;s efforts in achieving Sustainable Development Goal 9 by developing quality, reliable and sustainable transborder infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
